  "Every Dubbo Council e-waste load follows the old Matthews/Sims route",
  "Sircel sends all reused assets through Good360",
  "Dubbo Support Center is already a Device Bank distribution site",
  "The proposed home site is approved for the business",
  "The second-hand dealer exemption definitely applies",
